flowchart TD
    A[Operator sees issue] --> B{Is it auth?}
    B -->|Yes| C[gizzi auth status]
    B -->|No| D{Is it config?}
    D -->|Yes| E[gizzi config show]
    D -->|No| F{Is it performance?}
    F -->|Yes| G[gizzi metrics / otel]
    F -->|No| H[Collect logs]
    C --> I{Resolved?}
    E --> I
    G --> I
    H --> J[Open support ticket]
    I -->|Yes| K[Document fix]
    I -->|No| H
    K --> L[Update runbook]

    style A fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#fff
    style I fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style K fill:#22c55e,stroke:#86efac,color:#000
